# armour/shared/pauldron_fur2_l: the small leather shoulder pad on the left shoulder (fur.2; LADDER-ARMOUR, STYLE_P2 25.6):
# the right one's cap lit from the top-left as it falls on this side; `when furtrim` a fur edge on its rim.
# Finish regions: R the rim, P the cap's face, W a spot on the shadow side. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
